      "side": 1,
      "message": "The [ITE SHI backend](https://source.corp.google.com/h/chrome-internal/chromeos/superproject/+/main:src/third_party/zephyrproject/zephyr/subsys/mgmt/ec_host_cmd/backends/ec_host_cmd_backend_shi_ite.c;l\u003d566;drc\u003d4e219fc5b089300a44495c3e604fb8a4fe5ab09a) requires CONFIG_PM_DEVICE_RUNTIME.\n\nShould this also have `default y if EC_HOST_CMD_BACKEND_SHI_ITE`?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 30,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "07e76be15fc65f6cdf41f0746aa174c4f94410ec",
